OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/realms/mscore/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Origin: http://localhost
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type
###


POST http://localhost:8080/realms/mscore/protocol/openid-connect/auth
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id=api-test
